v0.2.12 - declare remote.settings so the form can read configuration

The diagnostics panel rendered and reported "remote.settings unavailable".
The service was never declared in inject; cordis guards service access and
throws at property-evaluation time, so the component could not read it.

The official settings plugin declares remote.settings and configForms
among its inject list, which proves both are real declarable services.
Removing remote.settings in 0.2.7 was wrong.

inject is now ['slots','locale','configForms','remote.settings'].
310 tests.
